<h2>Fixed</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Auto start did nothing for script plugins.</strong> Ticking it called the binary loader directly, which answered that a ruby or perl script is not a valid executable. Loading now goes through the same path as the load command, so the interpreters get the chance to claim their own files.</li>
</ul>
</body></html>
